3 ph\u00e1t qua `AudioTrack` v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 tr\u1ec5 th\u1ea5p (< 20ms); \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n 3-State Feedback UI (DISCONNECTED, STANDBY, STREAMING_ACTIVE) tr\u00ean `MainActivity` v\u00e0 Foreground Notification.\n\n## 2. Nhi\u1ec7m V\u1ee5 K\u1ef9 Thu\u1eadt Chi Ti\u1ebft (Technical Checkpoints)\n- [ ] **TASK-2.4a:** Tri\u1ec3n khai `AdbStreamReceiverServer` (ho\u1eb7c `RawAudioSocketServer`) m\u1edf c\u1ed5ng TCP c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: `127.0.0.1:34567`) b\u1eb1ng Coroutine / Non-blocking IO.\n- [ ] **TASK-2.4b:** T\u1ea1o `PcmAudioTrackPlayer` qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00f2ng l\u1eb7p c\u1ea5p ph\u00e1t b\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ec7m `AudioTrack` \u0111\u1ed9 tr\u1ec5 th\u1ea5p (`AudioTrack.PERFORMANCE_MODE_LOW_LATENCY`).\n- [ ] **TASK-2.6a:** X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng StateFlow gi\u00e1m s\u00e1t 3 tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i Bridge: `DISCONNECTED` (m\u1ea5t li\u00ean k\u1ebft), `STANDBY` (\u0111\u00e3 li\u00ean k\u1ebft OS nh\u01b0ng bridge kh\u00f4ng stream), `STREAMING_ACTIVE` (SCO/Socket stream \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng).\n- [ ] **TASK-2.6b:** T\u00edch h\u1ee3p Action Button \"Stop Route\" tr\u00ean Foreground Notification v\u00e0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt UI badge m\u00e0u t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng.\n- [ ] **TASK-2.6c:** Vi\u1ebft Unit Tests tr\u00ean Android cho Stream Parser v\u00e0 State Transitions.\n\n## 3. Ti\u00eau Ch\u00ed Nghi\u1ec7m Thu (Acceptance Criteria)\n- [ ] **AC-2.1:** Kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y Socket Server kh\u00f4ng g\u00e2y crash Service v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00f3ng port khi d\u1eebng.\n- [ ] **AC-2.2:** Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd lu\u1ed3ng \u00e2m thanh kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea5p ph\u00e1t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1eeba trong v\u00f2ng l\u1eb7p \u0111\u1ecdc buffer (Zero-allocation audio loop).\n- [ ] **AC-2.3:** Ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed `./android/gradlew testDebugUnitTest` v\u01b0\u1ee3t qua 100%.", "role": "developer", "priority": 2, "scope": "medium", "complexity": "medium", "estimated_minutes": 120, "status": "